+#    The 2x2 inner glyph is a deterministic sub-sampling of the partner 4x4 glyph via mask[::2,::2]. This yields a solid
+#    2x2 square for the frame glyph and a 2-pixel diagonal signature for the ring glyph, so the miniature remains visible.
